  "description": "Kaartblad 38 covers the Rivierenland — the area between the great rivers (Rhine, Waal, Lek, Merwede). Features the fortified towns of Gorinchem and Vianen, dike villages along the rivers, brick-making areas, and the characteristic river landscape with floodplains and fruit orchards. Part of the [Luchtfoto 2024](../collection.json) collection — 25 cm RGB orthophotos from the Beeldmateriaal Nederland summer campaign, served as Cloud-Optimized GeoTIFFs (COGs).",
